01:57:33,292 --> 01:57:40,032
Then I would like to end. I'm sad, I'm sorry to leave.

1566
01:57:40,032 --> 01:57:44,492
Do you want to AT?

1567
01:57:44,492 --> 01:57:51,392
I think I've already done a lot of AT.

1568
01:57:51,392 --> 01:57:54,592
Setoguchi-san was shaking his head a lot.

1569
01:57:54,592 --> 01:58:04,112
Look at that Mr. T, he's got a cold look in his eyes. His eyes are not smiling.

1570
01:58:04,112 --> 01:58:07,052
It was after 23:00. There are people watching the show, you know.

1571
01:58:07,052 --> 01:58:12,192
Next week's show will be more substantial, and I'm sure we'll have a lot of content.

1572
01:58:12,192 --> 01:58:14,492
I would like to make it more intense, not in terms of time, so please look forward to it.

1573
01:58:14,492 --> 01:58:18,152
Thank you very much for your time today.negative verb ending used in informal speech (abbr. of negative verb ending "nu") 

